<title>MEXICO: FORECAST-Mexico 28-day Cetes seen at 26.45 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Mexico 28-day Cetes seen at 26.45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interest rates on Mexico's bellwether Cetes are seen rising 371 points to 26.45 percent, and rates are also seen rising at longer terms, according to a Reuters' survey of 11 Cetes dealers.</p>
<p>Following is a table comparing last week's primary rates versus expectations for this week's auction and the expected change in basis points.</p>
<p>    TERM	LAST WEEK    THIS WEEK'S SURVEY   CHANGE</p>
<p>    28-DAY     22.74	    26.45		   +371 bps</p>
<p>    91-DAY     25.11	    27.96		   +285 bps</p>
<p>    182-DAY    26.84	    28.84		   +200 bps</p>
<p>    1-YEAR     26.83	    29.01		   +218 bps</p>
<p>The results will be released by Banco de Mexico at 1830 EDT.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
</text>
